#: gallery-for-immich.php:506
msgid "Shared links (default)"
msgstr "Shared links (standaard)"

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:507
#: gallery-for-immich.php:507
msgid "Stream through WordPress"
msgstr "Streamen via WordPress"

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:508
#: gallery-for-immich.php:508
msgid "Ignore videos"
msgstr "Video's negeren"

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:511
#: gallery-for-immich.php:511
msgid "How it works:"
msgstr "Hoe het werkt:"

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:512
#: gallery-for-immich.php:512
msgid ""
"Stream through WordPress: Videos are streamed through this WordPress site, "
"so they also play for albums that are only shared with the API key's user. "
"Uses the bandwidth of your WordPress server, and needs allow_url_fopen in "
"PHP; if videos do not play, choose Shared links."
msgstr ""
"Streamen via WordPress: video's worden via deze WordPress-site gestreamd, "
"dus ze spelen ook af in albums die alleen met de gebruiker van de API-"
"sleutel gedeeld zijn. Gebruikt de bandbreedte van je WordPress-server en "
"vereist allow_url_fopen in PHP; spelen video's niet af, kies dan Shared "
"links."

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:513
#: gallery-for-immich.php:513
msgid ""
"Shared links: Creates temporary shared links on Immich (bypasses WordPress "
"server). The temporary links expire after a short period and will be removed "
"from Immich."
msgstr ""
"Shared links: creëert tijdelijke gedeelde links op Immich (omzeilt WordPress-"
"server). De tijdelijke links verlopen na korte tijd en worden uit Immich "
"verwijderd."

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:514
#: gallery-for-immich.php:514
msgid "Ignore videos: Videos will not be displayed in galleries."
msgstr "Video's negeren: video's worden niet weergegeven in galerijen."

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:515
#: gallery-for-immich.php:515
msgid ""
"On password-protected and private pages, videos are always streamed through "
"WordPress, because a shared link cannot be protected."
msgstr ""
"Op pagina's met een wachtwoord en privépagina's worden video's altijd via "
"WordPress gestreamd, omdat een shared link niet af te schermen is."

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:525
#: gallery-for-immich.php:525
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Uit"

#: dist/release-check/gallery-for-immich/gallery-for-immich.php:526
